# Backend classification

You are working on the **BACKEND** of SpaceForge.

## Boundaries
- Edit only under `backend/`.
- Do **not** change `frontend/` UI unless the user explicitly asks for frontend work.
- Phase 0.1 modular monolith: Django + DRF + Celery + Postgres + Redis + S3/MinIO.
- Product AI pipelines are **not** here yet (echo job worker only).

## Local test
- API: http://localhost:8000
- Swagger: http://localhost:8000/api/docs/
- Health: http://localhost:8000/health/
- Start: `npm run dev:backend` (from repo root) or `cd backend && docker compose up --build`
- Env: `backend/.env` (copy from `backend/.env.example`)
- Dev auth: `Authorization: Bearer dev:<uid>:<email>`

## Domain apps (`backend/apps/`)
identity · organizations · workspaces · memberships · permissions · storage · datasets · jobs · notifications · events · audit · billing · platform · api · core

## Rule
Keep multi-tenant org scoping and RBAC intact. Frontend consumes this via future REST adapters — do not add Firebase/BaaS calls into Django domains.
